    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1973297565434327112",
      "url": "https://x.com/CosplayManiaPH/status/1973297565434327112",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/CosplayManiaPH/status/1973297565434327112",
      "text": "𝐁𝐮𝐲 𝐲𝐨𝐮𝐫 𝐭𝐢𝐜𝐤𝐞𝐭𝐬 𝐨𝐧𝐬𝐢𝐭𝐞 𝐚𝐧𝐝/𝐨𝐫 𝐜𝐥𝐚𝐢𝐦 𝐲𝐨𝐮𝐫 𝐰𝐫𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐛𝐚𝐧𝐝𝐬 𝐨𝐫 𝐛𝐚𝐝𝐠𝐞𝐬 𝐚𝐬 𝐞𝐚𝐫𝐥𝐲 𝐚𝐬 𝐭𝐨𝐦𝐨𝐫𝐫𝐨𝐰 for 🍁 Cσʂρʅαყ Mαɳια 2025 🍁! Starting Thursday (Oct 2, 2025) from 10:00 AM until 7:00 PM, you can already start claiming your wristbands and badges or purchase tickets onsite if you haven't already at the SMX Convention Center Manila Lobby. 𝑇𝑖𝑐𝑘𝑒𝑡𝑠 𝑤𝑖𝑙𝑙 𝑠𝑡𝑖𝑙𝑙 𝑏𝑒 𝑎𝑣𝑎𝑖𝑙𝑎𝑏𝑙𝑒 𝑓𝑜𝑟 𝑠𝑎𝑙𝑒 𝑜𝑛 𝑂𝑐𝑡 3, 4 𝑎𝑛𝑑 5.\n\nFor more information about wristband claiming click here: https://t.co/6FwywQ7Zd7\n\n𝗔𝘃𝗮𝗶𝗹𝗮𝗯𝗹𝗲 𝗧𝗶𝗰𝗸𝗲𝘁𝘀 𝗮𝗿𝗲 𝗮𝘀 𝗳𝗼𝗹𝗹𝗼𝘄𝘀 (while supplies last):\n\n𝐒𝐢𝐥𝐯𝐞𝐫 𝐏𝐨𝐫𝐭𝐚𝐥 𝐏𝐚𝐬𝐬 (𝟑-𝐃𝐚𝐲 𝐏𝐚𝐬𝐬) *𝐒𝐎𝐋𝐃 𝐎𝐔𝐓*\n\n𝐒𝐢𝐥𝐯𝐞𝐫 𝐓𝐢𝐜𝐤𝐞𝐭 - 𝐃𝐚𝐲 𝟏, 𝐃𝐚𝐲 𝟐 𝐨𝐫 𝐃𝐚𝐲 𝟑\n𝐏𝟕𝟎𝟎 𝒐𝒏𝒔𝒊𝒕𝒆\n🎟️1-Day Convention Ticket includes Hall EX, Hall SP, and Hall MG access\n🎟️Regular entry time into the convention\n🎟️Regular entrance to SMX Convention Center\n🎟️Complete SideQuest stamp rally to claim prizes\n🚫Does not include the 𝑱𝑨𝑴 𝑪𝒐𝒏𝒄𝒆𝒓𝒕 on that day\n\n𝐒𝐡𝐨𝐩𝐩𝐞𝐫'𝐬 𝐏𝐚𝐬𝐬 - 𝐃𝐚𝐲 𝟏, 𝐃𝐚𝐲 𝟐 𝐨𝐫 𝐃𝐚𝐲 𝟑\n𝐏𝟐𝟓𝟎 𝒐𝒏𝒔𝒊𝒕𝒆\n🛒1-Day Convention Ticket includes Hall EX and Hall MG access\n🛒𝟲:𝟬𝟬 𝗣𝗠 𝐨𝐧𝐰𝐚𝐫𝐝𝐬 entry time into the convention\n🛒Regular entrance to SMX Convention Center\n🚫No SideQuest stamp rally\n🚫Does not include the 𝑱𝑨𝑴 𝑪𝒐𝒏𝒄𝒆𝒓𝒕 on that day\n\n𝐆𝐨𝐥𝐝 𝐓𝐢𝐜𝐤𝐞𝐭 - 𝐃𝐚𝐲 𝟏\n𝐏𝟏,𝟐𝟎𝟎 𝒐𝒏𝒔𝒊𝒕𝒆\n🎫Full Day Access to Hall EX, Hall SP, and Hall MG on October 3, 2025\n🎫Regular entry time into the convention\n🎫Regular entrance to SMX Convention Center\n🎫Complete SideQuest stamp rally to claim prizes\n🎸𝑱𝑨𝑴 𝑪𝒐𝒏𝒄𝒆𝒓𝒕 standing area behind reserved seating with 𝐌𝐢三𝐔𝐬𝐞 opening for 𝐎𝐜𝐭𝐚𝐯𝐢𝐨 and 𝐒𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐚𝐭𝐬𝐮 𝐍𝐨 𝐏𝐡𝐚𝐧𝐭𝐚𝐬𝐢𝐚\n\n𝐆𝐨𝐥𝐝 𝐓𝐢𝐜𝐤𝐞𝐭 - 𝐃𝐚𝐲 𝟐\n𝐏𝟏,𝟐𝟎𝟎 𝒐𝒏𝒔𝒊𝒕𝒆\n🎫Full Day Access to Hall EX, Hall SP, and Hall MG on October 4, 2025\n🎫Regular entry time into the convention\n🎫Regular entrance to SMX Convention Center\n🎫Complete SideQuest stamp rally to claim prizes\n🎸𝑱𝑨𝑴 𝑪𝒐𝒏𝒄𝒆𝒓𝒕 standing area behind reserved seating with 𝐍𝐚𝐧𝐚𝐢 𝐓𝐚𝐭𝐚𝐢 opening for 𝐒𝐭𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐨 𝐃𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐅𝐨𝐮𝐧𝐝𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 and 𝐓𝐑𝐔𝐄\n\n𝐆𝐨𝐥𝐝 𝐓𝐢𝐜𝐤𝐞𝐭 - 𝐃𝐚𝐲 𝟑\n𝐏𝟏,𝟕𝟎𝟎 𝒐𝒏𝒔𝒊𝒕𝒆\n🎫Full Day Access to Hall EX, Hall SP, and Hall MG on October 5, 2025\n🎫Regular entry time into the convention\n🎫Regular entrance to SMX Convention Center\n🎫Complete SideQuest stamp rally to claim prizes\n🎸𝑱𝑨𝑴 𝑪𝒐𝒏𝒄𝒆𝒓𝒕 standing area behind reserved seating with 𝐑𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐝𝐫𝐨𝐩 opening for 𝐔𝐧𝐧𝐚̈𝐦𝐞𝐝, 𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐞𝐥𝐚 and 𝐒𝐡𝐨𝐮𝐭𝐚 𝐀𝐨𝐢\n\n𝐕𝐈𝐏 𝐏𝐚𝐬𝐬 - 𝐃𝐚𝐲 𝟏\n𝐏𝟐,𝟖𝟎𝟎 𝒐𝒏𝒔𝒊𝒕𝒆\n💎Full Day Access to Hall EX, Hall SP, and Hall MG on October 3, 2025\n💎15-minute early entry into the convention\n💎Exclusive entrance to SMX Convention Center\n💎Skip to the end of SideQuest (claim prizes at SideQuest Redemption)\n💎Prestige Lounge access on October 3, 2025\n🎸𝑱𝑨𝑴 𝑪𝒐𝒏𝒄𝒆𝒓𝒕 front area reserved seating with 𝐌𝐢三𝐔𝐬𝐞 opening for 𝐎𝐜𝐭𝐚𝐯𝐢𝐨 and 𝐒𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐚𝐭𝐬𝐮 𝐍𝐨 𝐏𝐡𝐚𝐧𝐭𝐚𝐬𝐢𝐚\n\n𝐕𝐈𝐏 𝐏𝐚𝐬𝐬 - 𝐃𝐚𝐲 𝟐\n𝐏𝟐,𝟖𝟎𝟎 𝒐𝒏𝒔𝒊𝒕𝒆\n💎Full Day Access to Hall EX, Hall SP, and Hall MG on October 4, 2025\n💎15-minute early entry into the convention\n💎Exclusive entrance to SMX Convention Center\n💎Skip to the end of SideQuest (claim prizes at SideQuest Redemption)\n💎Prestige Lounge access on October 4, 2025\n🎸𝑱𝑨𝑴 𝑪𝒐𝒏𝒄𝒆𝒓𝒕 front area reserved seating with 𝐍𝐚𝐧𝐚𝐢 𝐓𝐚𝐭𝐚𝐢 opening for 𝐒𝐭𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐨 𝐃𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐅𝐨𝐮𝐧𝐝𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 and 𝐓𝐑𝐔𝐄\n\n𝐕𝐈𝐏 𝐏𝐚𝐬𝐬 - 𝐃𝐚𝐲 𝟑\n𝐏𝟑,𝟑𝟎𝟎 𝒐𝒏𝒔𝒊𝒕𝒆\n💎Full Day Access to Hall EX, Hall SP, and Hall MG on October 5, 2025\n💎15-minute early entry into the convention\n💎Exclusive entrance to SMX Convention Center\n💎Prestige Lounge access on October 5, 2025\n💎Skip to the end of SideQuest (claim prizes at SideQuest Redemption)\n🎸𝑱𝑨𝑴 𝑪𝒐𝒏𝒄𝒆𝒓𝒕 front area reserved seating with 𝐑𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐝𝐫𝐨𝐩 opening for 𝐔𝐧𝐧𝐚̈𝐦𝐞𝐝, 𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐞𝐥𝐚 and 𝐒𝐡𝐨𝐮𝐭𝐚 𝐀𝐨𝐢\n\nYou can still buy your tickets online at https://t.co/UjGAF5tgpH and prepare for awesomeness!\n\nCelebrate cosplay awesomeness at 🍁 Cσʂρʅαყ Mαɳια 2025 🍁: 𝒜𝓌𝑒𝓈𝑜𝓂𝑒 𝒜𝓊𝓉𝓊𝓂𝓃 on October 3-5, 2025 at Halls 1-4 at the SMX Convention Center Manila, Pasay City. Enjoy the Seasons of Cosplay unfold as we celebrate 25 years of cosplay together!\n\n#cosplay #cosplayph #CosplayMania2025",
